      en: ["The MAAC museum was officially opened to the public in 2004.", "The archaeological department manages a collection of over 50,000 pieces.", "It contains about 3,000 significant works of contemporary Ecuadorian art.", "The museum highlights civilizations dating back to 3500 BCE.", "The facility includes an auditorium with a capacity for hundreds of guests.", "The building's design integrates seamlessly with the Malecón 2000 urban project."],
