      hu: ["A stadion hivatalos megnyitójára 1945. október 21-én került sor.", "Ez volt az első olyan létesítmény Ecuadorban, amely csak futballra épült.", "A 2017-es bővítés után a befogadóképessége elérte a 40 000 főt.", "Névadója, George Capwell, az amerikai alapítója volt az Emelec klubnak.", "A rajongók La Caldera (A Katlan) néven emlegetik a forró hangulat miatt.", "A stadiont eredetileg egy mocsaras terület feltöltése után építették fel."],
      ro: ["Stadionul a fost inaugurat oficial la data de 21 octombrie 1945.", "A fost prima arenă din Ecuador construită exclusiv pentru fotbal.", "Capacitatea sa actuală este de circa 40.000 de locuri după renovarea din 2017.", "George Capwell, cel care dă numele arenei, a fost fondatorul clubului Emelec.", "Este supranumit La Caldera de către fani datorită atmosferei incendiare.", "Terenul pe care a fost construit a fost inițial o zonă mlăștinoasă drenată."],
      en: ["The stadium was officially inaugurated on October 21, 1945.", "It was the first sports venue in Ecuador dedicated solely to football.", "Its current seating capacity is approximately 40,000 after the 2017 expansion.", "Named after George Capwell, the American founder of Club Sport Emelec.", "The venue is nicknamed La Caldera due to the intense fan atmosphere.", "The stadium was originally built on land that required significant drainage."],
